  title "The Silver Thread and the Schism"
  summary "Gilt-Hand Yeaiu qi'Gleam, a penguin merchant in Aurora Stack, experiences a devastating vision when her dormant silver flipper-binding suddenly activates. The vision reveals the catastrophic collapse of the Forum Floe and the destruction of Aureate's civilization, caused by the very crystal infrastructure and trade networks she helped build after leaving E'frostlings to found Threshold. The collapse kills countless merchants and destroys the delicate Flipper Accord between surface and deep colonies, leaving only devastation and the haunting image of Kaela Stormfeather eternally arranging fabric in her ruined stall. Returned to her market stall, Yeaiu realizes the vision was prophecy rather than memory and must find her estranged partner Zheishongfeihua to warn of the impending catastrophe."
